[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4388822109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113480#issuecomment-4388822109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113480","id":4388822109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBZgcXQ","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T14:00:19Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T14:00:19Z","body":"This seems good in principle, but it seems that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp#L208 uses `prepend_period()` so I'm not sure we can just remove it.\r\n\r\nIt also looks like `NodePath::_update_hash_cache()` is pretty expensive, particularly \r\n\r\n```\r\n    StringName path = get_concatenated_names();\r\n    StringName subpath = get_concatenated_subnames();\r\n```\r\n\r\nIntuitively I agree with you that NodePath compares are probably more common than creation. But I think this does require some benchmarks. If this isn't true then this might make things overall slower, possibly by quite a bit.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api